{"id":"83dcad167d47dee4","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-algebraic-category.md","title":"分类范畴的有限积","display":"thm-algebraic-category — 分类范畴的有限积","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-thm-algebraic-category","aliases":["16-thm-algebraic-category"],"display":"thm-algebraic-category — 分类范畴的有限积","depends_on":["[[16-df-algebraic-category]]","[[16-df-category]]","[[16-df-finite-limits]]","[[16-df-functor]]","[[16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor]]"],"source":"Theorem 3.3.4 p.186 (PDF206); local detailed verification","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-algebraic-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-algebraic-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-algebraic-category — 分类范畴的有限积"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4887bd10ad98ca45\" href=\"?note=4887bd10ad98ca45\" title=\"16-df-algebraic-category\">16-df-algebraic-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8b663a0efd45aead\" href=\"?note=8b663a0efd45aead\" title=\"16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor\">16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Theorem 3.3.4 p.186 (PDF206); local detailed verification"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf C_A=\\mathbf C(\\Sigma,A)\">\\(\\mathbf C_A=\\mathbf C(\\Sigma,A)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_A\">\\(Q_A\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4887bd10ad98ca45\" href=\"?note=4887bd10ad98ca45\" title=\"16-df-algebraic-category\">16-df-algebraic-category</a>；谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinProd}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinProd}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PresFinProd}\">\\(\\mathrm{PresFinProd}\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8b663a0efd45aead\" href=\"?note=8b663a0efd45aead\" title=\"16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor\">16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=(\\sigma_1,\\ldots,\\sigma_n)\">\\(\\Gamma=(\\sigma_1,\\ldots,\\sigma_n)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta=(\\tau_1,\\ldots,\\tau_m)\">\\(\\Delta=(\\tau_1,\\ldots,\\tau_m)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\vec t]_A\">\\([\\vec t]_A\\)</span> 缩写对应 Hom 中的分量等价类列表。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf C_A)\\land\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathbf C_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}(Q_A,\\mathbf C_\\Sigma,\\mathbf C_A)\\land\\mathrm{PresFinProd}(Q_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf C_A)\\land\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathbf C_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}(Q_A,\\mathbf C_\\Sigma,\\mathbf C_A)\\land\\mathrm{PresFinProd}(Q_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n1_{\\mathbf C_A}&amp;\\coloneqq(),\\qquad \\Gamma\\times_{\\mathbf C_A}\\Delta\\coloneqq\\Gamma\\mathbin{+\\!+}\\Delta,\\\\\n\\pi_1^{\\Gamma,\\Delta}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\Gamma\\mathbin{+\\!+}\\Delta,\\Gamma,([\\langle0,i\\rangle]_A)_{i=1}^n\\rangle,\\\\\n\\pi_2^{\\Gamma,\\Delta}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\Gamma\\mathbin{+\\!+}\\Delta,\\Delta,([\\langle0,n+j\\rangle]_A)_{j=1}^m\\rangle,\\\\\n\\langle\\langle\\Theta,\\Gamma,\\xi\\rangle,\\langle\\Theta,\\Delta,\\zeta\\rangle\\rangle_{\\mathbf C_A}\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\Theta,\\Gamma\\mathbin{+\\!+}\\Delta,\\xi\\mathbin{+\\!+}\\zeta\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n1_{\\mathbf C_A}&amp;\\coloneqq(),\\qquad \\Gamma\\times_{\\mathbf C_A}\\Delta\\coloneqq\\Gamma\\mathbin{+\\!+}\\Delta,\\\\\n\\pi_1^{\\Gamma,\\Delta}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\Gamma\\mathbin{+\\!+}\\Delta,\\Gamma,([\\langle0,i\\rangle]_A)_{i=1}^n\\rangle,\\\\\n\\pi_2^{\\Gamma,\\Delta}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\Gamma\\mathbin{+\\!+}\\Delta,\\Delta,([\\langle0,n+j\\rangle]_A)_{j=1}^m\\rangle,\\\\\n\\langle\\langle\\Theta,\\Gamma,\\xi\\rangle,\\langle\\Theta,\\Delta,\\zeta\\rangle\\rangle_{\\mathbf C_A}\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\Theta,\\Gamma\\mathbin{+\\!+}\\Delta,\\xi\\mathbin{+\\!+}\\zeta\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：替换保持型属及同余保证复合良定义；替换结合律和变量替换单位律给范畴公理。到空列表的 Hom 是空积单点。两个投影的方程就是取列表前后分量；唯一性逐分量成立，所以拼接为积。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_A\">\\(Q_A\\)</span> 逐分量取更粗的商，保持复合、单位、空列表及所列投影，因此保持有限积。核对了原书陈述与证明，并在笔记内补齐代表无关性和泛性质。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-algebraic-category","status":"resolved","id":"4887bd10ad98ca45","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-algebraic-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-finite-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor","status":"resolved","id":"8b663a0efd45aead","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-algebraic-category","status":"resolved","id":"4887bd10ad98ca45","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf C_A=\\mathbf C(\\Sigma,A)$ 和 $Q_A$ 采用 [[16-df-algebraic-category]]；谓词 $\\mathrm{Cat}$、$\\mathrm{FinProd}$、$\\mathrm{Functor}$、$\\mathrm{PresFinProd}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":